# Per-pipeline private scratch — regenerable intermediates (candidate index,
# redispatch entries, fuzzy candidates, ...). Future-proof: covers any pipeline
# folder's temp_<label>/ (A1/temp_A1/, A2/temp_A2/, ...) without editing this
# file again per new pipeline.
*/temp_*/

